fix(desktop): open DevTools only when it is asked for

A development run opened a detached DevTools window on every launch, over
the app, with no way to turn it off.

The window now opens only when T3CODE_DESKTOP_DEVTOOLS=1 is set, read
through DesktopConfig like the other desktop flags and carried on the
desktop environment as openDevToolsOnLaunch. Development is still a
precondition, so a packaged build is unaffected.

